martinmunk-alsa-control-avr (0.2.5) stable; urgency=medium

  * postinst: add the shairport-sync service user to the dialout group so the
    serial AVR backends (Opalum/NAD) can access /dev/ttyUSB* when shairport
    drives the mixer (guarded; no-op if that user is absent).
  * Recommends cec-utils (the CEC backend shells out to cec-client).
  * Point Homepage at Forgejo (gitea is being decommissioned).

